Thanks for the email.

I just wanted to add something useful that came up during the other meetings: the platform should be closed. Users should only be able to access the platform after being invited by me.
Alternatively, users could submit a registration request, which I would then need to approve before their account is created.

Good luck!


Stef Van Wolputte
