Subject: Meeting Minutes

Dear Mr. Stef,

Thank you again for taking the time to meet with us today. The team is very excited to work on this project with you.
In the attachments you can find the notes we took this meeting.

We would also like to remind you if it would be possible to provide us with the Excel sheet you currently use that documents the inventory?

Looking forward to our continued collaboration.

With kind regards,
The team



